Depends on the main branch of NimContracts
(github.com/lbartoletti/NimContracts), MIT-licensed.

Palette extraction delegates to UniColor
(github.com/lituus-lab/UniColor), Apache-2.0-licensed.


The `src/UniImage/exif/` subpackage and the EXIF/XMP/IPTC surface in
`src/UniImage/exif.nim` are migrated from nim-exif
(github.com/lbartoletti/nim-exif), Apache-2.0. Format codecs are independent
implementations from public format specifications;
no third-party codec implementation is vendored.

The WebP implementation was cross-checked against Google's libwebp reference
implementation (Copyright 2010 Google Inc.), which is BSD-3-Clause licensed
and accompanied by the WebM Project's royalty-free patent grant. libwebp is
not vendored or linked by UniImage.
